msgid "Use existing Quarkus MicroMeter OTLP registry"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Simply inject the Meter registry into your code -- it will periodically push "
"metrics to Grafana LGTM's OTLP HTTP endpoint."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Where you can then check Grafana's datasource API for existing metrics data."
msgstr ""
